      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The giant pirate skeleton makes two Strikes with its claw against one foe. The multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks are resolved.\n\nThe giant pirate skeleton doesn't use this ability if there is more than one creature within its reach that it can see."
